zreader 0.7.0 / LOCAL BOX BUILD ONLY / NOT DEPLOYED

Done
6. Lazy visible-row cover requests; input path does no disk I/O, rendering,
   waiting mutex or child wait. RAM LRU 32 x 96x128 grayscale. Single low-priority
   background worker reads cache and starts an isolated first-page renderer.
   Child deadline 12s, address space <=256 MiB, parent-death cleanup. Broken /
   huge-complex covers show a placeholder. Disk cache DATA/thumbs is capped at
   10 MiB regular .zrt files with oldest-file eviction; symlinks not followed.
   Cache keys: path + file size + mtime, refreshed next session if book changes.
   Relative subfolder picker (including distinct nested paths), All reset,
   persisted Recent/Title/Progress sorts, per-book reading progress bars.
8. Native powerd 0..24 brightness and warmth; separate +/- and drag sliders.
   Startup values read asynchronously; no startup write or saved-value override.
   Explicit changes alone queue writes, 250ms trailing debounce. Pending final
   changes flush on normal exit; failed writes show last confirmed levels.
   Commands spawn without a shell and timeout/reap after 2s; no extra libraries.
7. Power button sleeps toggle, default OFF, explicit opt-in persists separately
   in ui07.json. Exclusive raw power input grab required; OFF retains v0.6 exit.
   Completed cover/Sleeping-screen GC16 precedes deliberate powerButton request.
   powerd owns suspend. Subscribes goingToScreenSaver/outOfScreenSaver/
   readyToSuspend/wakeupFromSuspend; state fallback only after confirmed sleep.
   Housekeeping wakeupFromSuspend alone does not expose the reading page.
   Prefetch pauses, sleep touch ignored, wake restores exact cached view via GC16.
   Transition deadline 8s, CLI/subscription failure disables sleep and restores.
   Independent maintenance restore-ui stops reader, CONTs exact paused UI list,
   restarts pillow/statusbar, clears inhibitor and requests stock home.

